---
title: Carrott Cookies
author: Louise Kennedy
---

== Cookies ==

Preheat #oven{} to 350°F.

Mix together @shortening{1%cup}(scant), @egg{1}, and @sugar{3/4%cup}, @flour{2%cups}(sifted), @baking powder{1%tsp}, @vanilla{1%tsp}, and @salt{1%tsp}(approximately).

Fold in @cooked carrots{1%cup}(mashed).

> About 3 large carrots.

Drop spoonfuls of dough onto a #baking sheet{}.

Bake for ~{15%minutes}.

== Icing ==

Combine @powdered sugar{1%cup} with @orange juice, adding the juice gradually until the icing reaches the desired consistency.

Optionally, add grated orange zest.